# Glossary

Canonical terms of **{{PROJECT_NAME}}**, as the client uses them. Use the term
everywhere — documents, tickets, code, UI — and treat "Not" as banned. Maintained by
the repository owner; with `tsh-product-management` installed,
`/tsh-product-management:domain-dictionary` builds a fuller dictionary.

| Term | Meaning | Not |
| --- | --- | --- |
| {{PROJECT_NAME}} | The project and the client-facing name of what it delivers. | — |
